  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 1,
  "question": {
    "text": "If the point on the curve <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;nearest to the point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>(</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>)</mo></math> is equal to _________.",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "9",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>We have,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>Comparing with&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></math>, we get&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/4ac39880-ad95-47e5-a48a-8013a1d10750-image.png\" style=\"width: 411px; height: 230px;\" /></p><p>Let the point on parabola be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>&#8801;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8801;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>.</p><p>Normal at point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math>&nbsp;is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></math></p><p>It passes through <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>, hence</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Hence,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>&#8801;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>Therefore,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>(</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn></math></p>",
    "image": null
